[1.009, "o", "\u001b[1mConnected to Trip Planner (elicitation demo) at http://localhost:3000/mcp\u001b[22m\r\n\u001b[2mProtocol 2026-07-28 · elicitation: form + url\r\n\u001b[22m\r\n"]
